		<item>
		<title>Jermaine Haley, known as Bronson Reed of WWE, passes away at 38</title>
		<link>https://www.wrestleview.com/wwe-news/398550-jermaine-haley-known-as-bronson-reed-of-wwe-passes-away-at-38/</link>
					<comments>https://www.wrestleview.com/wwe-news/398550-jermaine-haley-known-as-bronson-reed-of-wwe-passes-away-at-38/#respond</comments>
		
		<dc:creator><![CDATA[Mike Tedesco]]></dc:creator>
		<pubDate>Sat, 28 Nov 2026 00:38:09 +0000</pubDate>
				<category><![CDATA[Top Story]]></category>
		<category><![CDATA[WWE News]]></category>
		<category><![CDATA[Bronson Reed]]></category>
		<category><![CDATA[passes away]]></category>
		<guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.wrestleview.com/?p=398550</guid>

					<description><![CDATA[<p>WWE announced on Friday evening that Bronson Reed (real name Jermaine Haley) passed away earlier today at the&#8230;</p>
<p>The post <a href="https://www.wrestleview.com/wwe-news/398550-jermaine-haley-known-as-bronson-reed-of-wwe-passes-away-at-38/">Jermaine Haley, known as Bronson Reed of WWE, passes away at 38</a> appeared first on <a href="https://www.wrestleview.com">WWE News, WWE Results, AEW News, AEW Results</a>.</p>
]]></description>
										<content:encoded><![CDATA[
<p class="wp-block-paragraph">WWE announced on Friday evening that Bronson Reed (real name Jermaine Haley) passed away earlier today at the age of 38 due to medical complications.</p>



<p class="wp-block-paragraph">Reed had been recovering from injuries sustained at the WWE Crown Jewel premium live event in Riyadh, Saudi Arabia, earlier this month. He had remained in Saudi Arabia to receive medical treatment before returning home following surgery. At this time, it has not been confirmed whether his passing was related to those injuries.</p>



<p class="wp-block-paragraph">A native of Australia, Reed signed with WWE in 2019 and went on to capture the NXT North American Championship. Following his departure from the company in 2021, Reed competed in IMPACT Wrestling and New Japan Pro Wrestling under the name JONAH before returning to WWE in December 2022.</p>



<p class="wp-block-paragraph">Reed would go on to win the 2024 André the Giant Memorial Battle Royal and establish himself as one of the most impressive big men in the industry. Most recently, Reed was a member of The Vision on WWE Raw.</p>



<p class="wp-block-paragraph">Haley is survived by his wife, Paige, and their young daughter, who was born in February 2024. The couple was expecting their second child at the time of his passing.</p>



<p class="wp-block-paragraph">On behalf of the entire staff of Wrestleview.com, we would like to extend our deepest and most heartfelt condolences to Haley’s family, friends, colleagues, and fans throughout the world during this incredibly difficult time.</p>



<p class="wp-block-paragraph"></p>



<p class="wp-block-paragraph"></p>



<p class="wp-block-paragraph"></p>
<p>The post <a href="https://www.wrestleview.com/wwe-news/398550-jermaine-haley-known-as-bronson-reed-of-wwe-passes-away-at-38/">Jermaine Haley, known as Bronson Reed of WWE, passes away at 38</a> appeared first on <a href="https://www.wrestleview.com">WWE News, WWE Results, AEW News, AEW Results</a>.</p>
]]></content:encoded>
					
					<wfw:commentRss>https://www.wrestleview.com/wwe-news/398550-jermaine-haley-known-as-bronson-reed-of-wwe-passes-away-at-38/feed/</wfw:commentRss>
			<slash:comments>0</slash:comments>
		
		
			</item>
		<item>
		<title>WWE Elimination Chamber location teased for 2027</title>
		<link>https://www.wrestleview.com/featured-top-story/398547-wwe-elimination-chamber-location-teased-for-2027/</link>
					<comments>https://www.wrestleview.com/featured-top-story/398547-wwe-elimination-chamber-location-teased-for-2027/#respond</comments>
		
		<dc:creator><![CDATA[Alex Kahrs]]></dc:creator>
		<pubDate>Sat, 28 Nov 2026 00:26:23 +0000</pubDate>
				<category><![CDATA[Featured Top Story]]></category>
		<category><![CDATA[WWE News]]></category>
		<category><![CDATA[Elimination Chamber]]></category>
		<category><![CDATA[WWE]]></category>
		<guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.wrestleview.com/?p=398547</guid>

					<description><![CDATA[<p>The Prudential Center in Newark, New Jersey posted a teaser on social media, indicating it will play host&#8230;</p>
<p>The post <a href="https://www.wrestleview.com/featured-top-story/398547-wwe-elimination-chamber-location-teased-for-2027/">WWE Elimination Chamber location teased for 2027</a> appeared first on <a href="https://www.wrestleview.com">WWE News, WWE Results, AEW News, AEW Results</a>.</p>
]]></description>
										<content:encoded><![CDATA[
<p class="wp-block-paragraph">The Prudential Center in Newark, New Jersey posted a teaser on social media, indicating it will play host to the 2027 edition of WWE Elimination Chamber.</p>



<p class="wp-block-paragraph">Past years have seen the event take place between the Royal Rumble and WrestleMania, though no date has been made official as of this writing.</p>



<p class="wp-block-paragraph">The 2027 Royal Rumble is set for February 6 from Glendale, Arizona, and WrestleMania 43 is set to emanate from Riyadh, Saudi Arabia with an expected date of April 10-11.</p>



<p class="wp-block-paragraph">The teaser post from the venue follows a pattern established by other venues earlier this year.</p>



<figure class="wp-block-embed is-type-rich is-provider-x wp-block-embed-x"><div class="wp-block-embed__wrapper">
<blockquote class="twitter-tweet" data-width="550" data-dnt="true"><p lang="qme" dir="ltr"><img src="https://s.w.org/images/core/emoji/17.0.2/72x72/1f440.png" alt="👀" class="wp-smiley" style="height: 1em; max-height: 1em;" /> <a href="https://t.co/zGemw4wegs">pic.twitter.com/zGemw4wegs</a></p>&mdash; Prudential Center (@PruCenter) <a href="https://x.com/PruCenter/status/2126361480652321097?ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw">November 27, 2026</a></blockquote><script async src="https://platform.x.com/widgets.js" charset="utf-8"></script>
</div></figure>
<p>The post <a href="https://www.wrestleview.com/featured-top-story/398547-wwe-elimination-chamber-location-teased-for-2027/">WWE Elimination Chamber location teased for 2027</a> appeared first on <a href="https://www.wrestleview.com">WWE News, WWE Results, AEW News, AEW Results</a>.</p>
]]></content:encoded>
					
