					<description><![CDATA[<p>AEW&#8217;s Gabe Kidd spent Thanksgiving with a fan. Kidd, who missed his flight out of Omaha, Nebraska on&#8230;</p>
<p>The post <a href="https://www.wrestleview.com/aew-news/398539-aew-talent-spends-thanksgiving-with-a-fan-and-his-family/">AEW talent spends Thanksgiving with a fan and his family</a> appeared first on <a href="https://www.wrestleview.com">WWE News, WWE Results, AEW News, AEW Results</a>.</p>
]]></description>
										<content:encoded><![CDATA[
<p class="wp-block-paragraph">AEW&#8217;s Gabe Kidd spent Thanksgiving with a fan. </p>



<p class="wp-block-paragraph">Kidd, who missed his flight out of Omaha, Nebraska on Wednesday following the live Dynamite and Collision taping, took to social media asking about getting a plate of food for Thanksgiving. </p>



<p class="wp-block-paragraph">A fan answered the call and Kidd spent Thanksgiving with the fan at his grandmother&#8217;s home. </p>



