		<item>
		<title>Fired TNA referee reportedly generating interest from independent promotions</title>
		<link>https://www.wrestleview.com/impact-wrestling-news/398531-fired-tna-referee-reportedly-generating-interest-from-independent-promotions/</link>
					<comments>https://www.wrestleview.com/impact-wrestling-news/398531-fired-tna-referee-reportedly-generating-interest-from-independent-promotions/#respond</comments>
		
		<dc:creator><![CDATA[Jerome Wilen]]></dc:creator>
		<pubDate>Fri, 27 Nov 2026 03:11:57 +0000</pubDate>
				<category><![CDATA[Impact News]]></category>
		<category><![CDATA[Impact Wrestling News]]></category>
		<category><![CDATA[independent promotions]]></category>
		<category><![CDATA[interest]]></category>
		<category><![CDATA[Mike Romo]]></category>
		<category><![CDATA[referee]]></category>
		<category><![CDATA[TNA]]></category>
		<guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.wrestleview.com/?p=398531</guid>

					<description><![CDATA[<p>Recently fired TNA referee Mike “Romo” Romanella reportedly continues to generate interest elsewhere in the wrestling business, according&#8230;</p>
<p>The post <a href="https://www.wrestleview.com/impact-wrestling-news/398531-fired-tna-referee-reportedly-generating-interest-from-independent-promotions/">Fired TNA referee reportedly generating interest from independent promotions</a> appeared first on <a href="https://www.wrestleview.com">WWE News, WWE Results, AEW News, AEW Results</a>.</p>
]]></description>
										<content:encoded><![CDATA[
<p class="wp-block-paragraph">Recently fired TNA referee Mike “Romo” Romanella reportedly continues to generate interest elsewhere in the wrestling business, according to Fightful Select. </p>



<p class="wp-block-paragraph">The report also notes multiple independent wrestling promotions have expressed interest in booking him for referee work.</p>



<p class="wp-block-paragraph">TNA escorted Romanella out of the company’s television tapings in Calgary, Alberta, last week because the company learned he had been actively working in the adult film industry. Fightful Select had reported TNA and its parent company Anthem Sports &amp; Entertainment received an email containing links to his adult film work, which included material that was reportedly produced over the summer.</p>
<p>The post <a href="https://www.wrestleview.com/impact-wrestling-news/398531-fired-tna-referee-reportedly-generating-interest-from-independent-promotions/">Fired TNA referee reportedly generating interest from independent promotions</a> appeared first on <a href="https://www.wrestleview.com">WWE News, WWE Results, AEW News, AEW Results</a>.</p>
]]></content:encoded>
					
					<wfw:commentRss>https://www.wrestleview.com/impact-wrestling-news/398531-fired-tna-referee-reportedly-generating-interest-from-independent-promotions/feed/</wfw:commentRss>
			<slash:comments>0</slash:comments>
		
		
			</item>
