		<item>
		<title>‘Bad Lieutenant: Tokyo’ starring Liv Morgan gets  theatrical release date in the United States</title>
		<link>https://www.wrestleview.com/wwe-news/398465-bad-lieutenant-tokyo-starring-liv-morgan-gets-theatrical-release-date-in-the-united-states/</link>
					<comments>https://www.wrestleview.com/wwe-news/398465-bad-lieutenant-tokyo-starring-liv-morgan-gets-theatrical-release-date-in-the-united-states/#respond</comments>
		
		<dc:creator><![CDATA[Jerome Wilen]]></dc:creator>
		<pubDate>Fri, 27 Nov 2026 00:25:10 +0000</pubDate>
				<category><![CDATA[WWE News]]></category>
		<category><![CDATA[Bad Lieutenant: Tokyo]]></category>
		<category><![CDATA[Liv Morgan]]></category>
		<category><![CDATA[release date]]></category>
		<category><![CDATA[United States]]></category>
		<category><![CDATA[WWE]]></category>
		<guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.wrestleview.com/?p=398465</guid>

					<description><![CDATA[<p>NEON, the distributor for &#8216;Bad Lieutenant: Tokyo&#8217;, featuring WWE Women’s World Champion Liv Morgan, has announced the film&#8230;</p>
<p>The post <a href="https://www.wrestleview.com/wwe-news/398465-bad-lieutenant-tokyo-starring-liv-morgan-gets-theatrical-release-date-in-the-united-states/">‘Bad Lieutenant: Tokyo’ starring Liv Morgan gets  theatrical release date in the United States</a> appeared first on <a href="https://www.wrestleview.com">WWE News, WWE Results, AEW News, AEW Results</a>.</p>
]]></description>
										<content:encoded><![CDATA[
<p class="wp-block-paragraph">NEON, the distributor for &#8216;Bad Lieutenant: Tokyo&#8217;, featuring WWE Women’s World Champion Liv Morgan, has announced the film will hit theaters in the United States on March 5, 2027. </p>



<figure class="wp-block-embed is-type-rich is-provider-x wp-block-embed-x"><div class="wp-block-embed__wrapper">
<blockquote class="twitter-tweet" data-width="550" data-dnt="true"><p lang="en" dir="ltr">A new chapter begins. BAD LIEUTENANT: TOKYO, from filmmaker Takashi Miike, stars Shun Oguri, Lily James, and Liv Morgan. In theaters March 5. <a href="https://t.co/3m5Gz7rnqe">pic.twitter.com/3m5Gz7rnqe</a></p>&mdash; NEON (@neonrated) <a href="https://x.com/neonrated/status/2125637145419227173?ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw">November 25, 2026</a></blockquote><script async src="https://platform.x.com/widgets.js" charset="utf-8"></script>
</div></figure>



<p class="wp-block-paragraph">&#8216;Bad Lieutenant: Tokyo follows seasoned Tokyo detective Yabuki (Shun Oguri), who battles drug addiction, gambling debts and past guilt while he tracks a killer tied to organized crime. His investigation intersects with American FBI agent Gwen Birgssen (Lily James), who is searching for missing American tourist Megan Lovesey (Liv Morgan).</p>



<p class="wp-block-paragraph">&#8216;Bad Lieutenant: Tokyo&#8217; premiered at the Toronto International Film Festival back on September 14 and was released in theaters in Japan on October 23. </p>



<p class="wp-block-paragraph">The 2nd official trailer for the film, can be seen below.</p>



<figure class="wp-block-embed is-type-video is-provider-youtube wp-block-embed-youtube wp-embed-aspect-16-9 wp-has-aspect-ratio"><div class="wp-block-embed__wrapper">
<iframe title="BAD LIEUTENANT: TOKYO Official Trailer 2 (2026) Liv Morgan, Takashi Miike" width="1200" height="675" src="https://www.youtube.com/embed/7UQlN30G95c?feature=oembed" frameborder="0" allow="accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture; web-share" referrerpolicy="strict-origin-when-cross-origin" allowfullscreen></iframe>
</div></figure>



<p class="wp-block-paragraph">Morgan was filming the movie while she way gone from WWE TV  in May 2025. It was revealed earlier this week from <a href="https://deadline.com/2026/11/hooters-the-movie-sets-cast-1237232108/" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer noopener">Deadline</a>, Morgan has been cast in ‘Hooters: The Movie”. She worked for the Hooters restaurant chain prior to her pro wrestling career. She is set to defend the Women&#8217;s World Title against Becky Lynch at WWE Survivor Series: WarGames this Saturday at Daikin Park in Houston, Texas.</p>
<p>The post <a href="https://www.wrestleview.com/wwe-news/398465-bad-lieutenant-tokyo-starring-liv-morgan-gets-theatrical-release-date-in-the-united-states/">‘Bad Lieutenant: Tokyo’ starring Liv Morgan gets  theatrical release date in the United States</a> appeared first on <a href="https://www.wrestleview.com">WWE News, WWE Results, AEW News, AEW Results</a>.</p>
]]></content:encoded>
					
					<wfw:commentRss>https://www.wrestleview.com/wwe-news/398465-bad-lieutenant-tokyo-starring-liv-morgan-gets-theatrical-release-date-in-the-united-states/feed/</wfw:commentRss>
			<slash:comments>0</slash:comments>
		
		
			</item>
		<item>
		<title>WWF Raw Results &#8211; 11/25/96 (Bret &#8220;Hitman&#8221; Hart vs. Owen Hart, Rocky Maivia&#8217;s first Raw match)</title>
		<link>https://www.wrestleview.com/retro/398461-wwf-raw-results-november-25-1996-new-haven/</link>
					<comments>https://www.wrestleview.com/retro/398461-wwf-raw-results-november-25-1996-new-haven/#respond</comments>
		
		<dc:creator><![CDATA[Mike Tedesco]]></dc:creator>
		<pubDate>Thu, 26 Nov 2026 21:23:34 +0000</pubDate>
				<category><![CDATA[Featured Top Story]]></category>
		<category><![CDATA[Retro]]></category>
		<category><![CDATA[WWE News]]></category>
		<category><![CDATA[1996]]></category>
		<category><![CDATA[Connecticut]]></category>
		<category><![CDATA[Monday Night Raw]]></category>
		<category><![CDATA[Monday Night War]]></category>
		<category><![CDATA[New Haven]]></category>
		<category><![CDATA[November 25]]></category>
		<category><![CDATA[WWE]]></category>
		<category><![CDATA[WWE RAW Results]]></category>
		<category><![CDATA[WWE results]]></category>
		<category><![CDATA[WWF]]></category>
		<category><![CDATA[WWF Raw Results]]></category>
